WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.570
Welcome to Blanche Beauty: nails, lashes and brows, at the studio in Nijmegen.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.814
In a few minutes you will see the app for your clients,

00:00:09.814 --> 00:00:12.259
and the admin panel for your team, live in 3D.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:20.171
Open the app and Blanche's logo first writes itself. Then the studio opens.

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:25.305
The home screen greets your client by name, with her next appointment.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:29.729
When her set is almost three weeks old, the app suggests a new one:

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:32.240
at her usual time, with the same stylist.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.522
News from the studio comes as stories, just like on Instagram.

00:00:37.522 --> 00:00:39.157
Tap to see the next one.

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:44.151
Under inspiration you swipe through real Blanche sets.

00:00:44.151 --> 00:00:46.746
Swipe right to save one, left to move on.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.567
In the shade studio you pick a colour, and it appears on a real hand right away.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:01:00.037
From soft nude to bright red: your client knows what she wants before she walks in.

00:01:01.367 --> 00:01:05.614
Under Book you find Blanche's full menu, with the real times and prices.

00:01:06.287 --> 00:01:10.195
Nails, lashes and brows each have their own colour.

00:01:11.233 --> 00:01:14.747
Every treatment has its own page: how it works,

00:01:14.747 --> 00:01:17.663
how long it lasts, and nail art to add.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:23.983
Then pick a stylist, or leave it to the studio. Then a day and a time.

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:26.567
Confirm, and done.

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:32.723
The appointment appears as a ticket, with a code to check in at the desk.

00:01:34.733 --> 00:01:37.262
In the Blanche Club your client earns points,

00:01:37.262 --> 00:01:39.678
and moves up from Blanc to Rosé and Cerise.

00:01:39.998 --> 00:01:44.925
She trades her points for nail art, or even a free Korean lash lift.

00:01:44.925 --> 00:01:47.751
And a post or a review earns her extra.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.148
The shop has the aftercare her stylist recommends, and gift cards.

00:01:53.148 --> 00:01:55.256
One tap and it is in her basket.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.220
Under Profile are her appointments and earlier sets.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:02.139
With Again she books exactly the same set once more.

00:02:03.767 --> 00:02:08.048
And on a computer everything works as an ordinary website, in six languages.

00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:12.649
Then the admin panel, for the team.

00:02:12.649 --> 00:02:16.446
Today's numbers count up, and the studio appears in 3D.

00:02:16.766 --> 00:02:19.261
At each table a stylist works with her client.

00:02:19.261 --> 00:02:21.756
Whoever sits on the bench is waiting her turn.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.910
Click a stylist, and the client card opens.

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:30.994
What she is having done now, her earlier sets and colours, and the stylist's notes.

00:02:31.314 --> 00:02:32.848
Press Escape to go back.

00:02:34.767 --> 00:02:39.275
Everything runs live. When a client pays, the amount flies to the till,

00:02:39.275 --> 00:02:41.498
and the next client takes her seat.

00:02:41.818 --> 00:02:44.034
On the right, what just happened comes in.

00:02:45.667 --> 00:02:50.228
The diary shows the day per stylist, with new bookings from the app in between.

00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:53.295
When someone's set is more than three weeks old,

00:02:53.295 --> 00:02:55.438
she is listed under Time for a refill.

00:02:55.438 --> 00:02:58.316
One click, and everyone gets a reminder in the app.

00:02:59.367 --> 00:03:04.239
The week's revenue stands in columns: nails, lashes, brows and the shop.

00:03:04.239 --> 00:03:06.541
Striped is what is already booked.

00:03:06.861 --> 00:03:09.802
And under Social you see what Instagram brings:

00:03:09.802 --> 00:03:12.180
tags, clicks to the app, and bookings.

00:03:13.233 --> 00:03:16.692
Want to see a whole day at once? Press Play the day.

00:03:17.153 --> 00:03:20.470
The tables fill up and empty again, and revenue grows,

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.804
from the first client to closing time.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:30.147
That was Blanche: one app for your clients, and one overview for your team. Enjoy!
